;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Terramite Shell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terramite_Shell_228974.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Terramite Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terramite_Legs_1c5781.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Terramite Eggs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terramite_Eggs_9abc5e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"DaramaTerramiteCave\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"76\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/DaramaTerramiteCave_03b61b.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.86<br/>April 23, 2013</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p>The <b>Darama Terramite Cave</b> is a cave located under the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel\">Kha'zeel</a> mountains, connecting <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a> desert (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33104,32697,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33104, 32697, 7)</a>) with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a> jungle (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32976,32686,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32976, 32686, 7)</a>). It consists of two <a href=\"#/wiki/Terramite\">Terramite</a> chambers separated by a small empty area inside the mountain, where players can catch their breath after hunting. If you have a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">pick</a>, you can reach at least one deeper cave with <a href=\"#/wiki/Terramite\">Terramites</a> (use it <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33027,32708,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33027, 32708, 8)</a>).\n</p><p>If you are just trying to cross the mountain, you can also walk the above ground route via the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Pass\">Kha'zeel Pass</a>.\n</p><p>It is advised to bring your own food (e.g. loot from <a href=\"#/wiki/Elephant\">Elephants</a> in the jungle) as Terramite Eggs are quite valuable and not recommended for consumption.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Terramite\"><img alt=\"Terramite\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terramite_ef397a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Terramite\">Terramite</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">365</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">116 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">16 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-45× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Terramite Legs (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Terramite Shell (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× Terramite Eggs (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest","the-explorer-society-quest"]}